flowchart TB
  accTitle: Holdings freshness pilot
  accDescr: A manual check reads Holdings status and source timestamps. A new incident produces one local report. Repeat observations are deduplicated. A healthy reading closes an open incident or leaves the log untouched.
  api["Read Holdings status and health"] --> times["Compare balance age, price age<br/>and source availability"]
  times --> state{"Source fresh?"}
  state -->|Yes| close["Close incident<br/>if open"]
  state -->|No| prior{"Already<br/>open?"}
  prior -->|Yes| same["No new<br/>report"]
  prior -->|No| log["Log one<br/>incident"]
